### Change Specification

**1. Flip the Camera Feed (Hardware Level)**
The ESP32 camera sensor has built-in hardware registers to mirror and flip the image. We will apply this immediately after the camera initializes.

**Target File:** `src/camera_server.cpp`
**Locate in `initCamera()`:**
```cpp
