    if (err != ESP_OK) {
        // In a real application, you might want to reboot or blink an error LED
        return;
    }
}
```
**Replace With:**
```cpp
    esp_err_t err = esp_camera_init(&config);
    if (err != ESP_OK) {
        return;
    }

    // Flip the image hardware registers
    sensor_t * s = esp_camera_sensor_get();
    s->set_vflip(s, 1);    // Flips vertically
    s->set_hmirror(s, 1);  // Flips horizontally so left/right remain accurate
}
```

**2. Reduce Latency (Software Level)**
Because we are grabbing a raw grayscale frame and manually compressing it to JPEG via software (`fmt2jpg`), the CPU and Wi-Fi bandwidth are bottlenecked. We will increase the JPEG compression (lowering quality, increasing speed) and remove the artificial 50ms delay in the streaming loop.

