2. The algorithm was locking onto "big clusters" because it couldn't tell the difference between a road line and a huge black shadow on the floor! We will upgrade the logic to measure the thickness of the line. If it finds a cluster that is thicker than ~40 pixels, it will reject it as a shadow and continue scanning for your slim road line.

